(EXECUTIVE EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT - PAGE 1) '
() '
(SECTION: 1. POSITION AND DUTIES) '
(Executive is employed as Lead AI Research Engineer, reporting directly to) '
(the Chief Technology Officer. Executive shall perform duties with) '
(professional excellence, loyalty, and fidelity.) '
() '
(SECTION: 2. COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS) '
(Executive shall receive an annual base salary of $185,000, payable) '
(semi-monthly, subject to statutory withholdings, along with comprehensive) '
(medical insurance, 401\(k\) matching, and annual incentive bonuses.) '
() '
(SECTION: 3. TERMINATION NOTICE PERIOD) '
(Executive or Company may terminate the employment relationship at any time) '
(by providing sixty \(60\) days advance written notice. Company reserves the) '
(right to provide compensation in lieu of notice period.) '
() '
